# Service files
#
# Code.gs is deliberately TRACKED. It holds no credentials - the FCM service-account key, web config and VAPID
# keys live in the system_settings sheet and Script Properties, and the file refers to them only by key name -
# and it uses getActiveSpreadsheet(), so no spreadsheet ID appears in it either. Keeping it here means the front
# end and back end are versioned together and reviewed in one place.
#
# The service-account JSON is a real credential and must never be committed. scripts/check-secrets.py (CI +
# the pre-commit hook) fails on either file if it ever is.
fire-clock-76723.json
*.pxd